<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 15:16:24 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>大海和阳光</title><link>https://some.pics/6a64d344c2182</link><description>&lt;p&gt;有时候你只需要大海和阳光。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Ein Becher mit blauer Hintergrundfarbe. Darauf eine Art Relief mit dem Text „Nimm Dir Zeit für Meer“. Unter dem Text ein Papierschiffchen auf Wellen.  Am oberen Trinkrand hat der Becher einen dunklen Rand. " height="4080" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dnk/6a64d344c2182.jpg" width="3072"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dnk.some.pics"&gt;@dnk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 15:16:24 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>充电时的水之框</title><link>https://some.pics/6a64d0468688d</link><description>&lt;p&gt;水的框架（或我在汽车充电时注意到的那些事）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A close-up of the corner of a windscreen, viewed from the inside. The round, black frame is surrounded by a frame made up of water droplets, the inner edge of which forms a 90-degree angle. The image is in black and white. " height="1052" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6a64d0468688d.jpg" width="1052"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 15:03:36 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a64b4c9441b8</link><description>&lt;p&gt;阿蒂巴亚 + 雨&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Atibaia + chuva" height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sergio/6a64b4c9441b8.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sergio.some.pics"&gt;@sergio&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 13:06:28 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>温暖图案</title><link>https://some.pics/6a6498f468f45</link><description>&lt;p&gt;温暖的图案。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A thistle blossom, closeup." height="2000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/z428/6a6498f468f45.jpg" width="1126"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://z428.some.pics"&gt;@z428&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 11:07:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>意大利2026年日落</title><link>https://some.pics/6a6494886d4ac</link><description>&lt;p&gt;日落，意大利（2026年）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Sunset, Italy (2026)" height="3888" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hiddenflair/6a6494886d4ac.jpg" width="5184"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hiddenflair.some.pics"&gt;@hiddenflair&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 10:48:43 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>